sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Browser/App)
    participant BE as Back End (REST API)
    participant DB as Database (MySQL)

    C->>BE: HTTP Request (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE)
    Note over C,BE: Header + Body (JSON) + Endpoint
    BE->>DB: Query SQL (SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE)
    DB-->>BE: Result Set / Affected Rows
    BE-->>C: HTTP Response (JSON + Status Code)
    Note over BE,C: 200 OK / 201 Created / 404 Not Found
    